## This project uses the JavaScript version of PDG (Pixel Dust Game engine) for rendering and control
- see ../pdg-devel/docs/javascript/pdg-js.h for an IDL file the expresses the API for PDG
- see ../pdg-devel/docs/javascript/html/ for more detailed PDG API documentation
- see ../galactica-4/src/js/ for an example of a well implemented simple PDG application
- see ../pdg-devel/test/ui_tests/ for examples of tested graphics functionality
- see ../pdg-devel/test/spec/ for examples of tested general functionality
- to run the app, use `./pdg`

